{"unit":{"id":"l1-u08","level":1,"order":8,"title":"Unit 8","wordIds":["w:找","w:打","w:还有","w:快","w:比","w:今天","w:话","w:还是","w:觉得","w:月","w:看到","w:起来"],"grammarIds":["g:gen-with","g:zenme-how"],"sentenceIds":["s:l1:057","s:l1:058","s:l1:059","s:l1:060","s:l1:093"]},"grammar":[{"id":"g:gen-with","title":"跟 for \"with someone\"","pattern":"Subject + 跟 + person + verb","explanation":"跟 (gēn) introduces a companion — \"with\" someone. It comes before the verb, not after: 我跟你去 (\"I'll go with you\"), not 我去跟你.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:053","s:l1:054","s:l1:055","s:l1:056"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"g:zenme-how","title":"怎么 for asking \"how\"","pattern":"怎么 + verb","explanation":"怎么 (zěnme) asks about manner or method — \"how\". It goes right before the verb: 这个怎么用? (\"How do you use this?\"). 你怎么了? is a fixed way of asking \"What's wrong (with you)?\"","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:049","s:l1:050","s:l1:051","s:l1:052"],"unitId":"l1-u08"}],"sentences":[{"id":"s:l1:057","zh":"他比我快。","pinyin":"Tā bǐ wǒ kuài.","en":"He is faster than me.","wordIds":["w:他","w:比","w:我","w:快"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:058","zh":"这个比那个好。","pinyin":"Zhège bǐ nàge hǎo.","en":"This one is better than that one.","wordIds":["w:这","w:个","w:比","w:那","w:个","w:好"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:059","zh":"我比他大。","pinyin":"Wǒ bǐ tā dà.","en":"I am older than him.","wordIds":["w:我","w:比","w:他","w:大"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:060","zh":"那个比这个小。","pinyin":"Nàge bǐ zhège xiǎo.","en":"That one is smaller than this one.","wordIds":["w:那","w:个","w:比","w:这","w:个","w:小"],"unitId":"l1-u08"},{"id":"s:l1:093","zh":"今天我很好。","pinyin":"Jīntiān wǒ hěn hǎo.","en":"Today I'm doing well.","wordIds":["w:今天","w:我","w:很","w:好"],"unitId":"l1-u08"}]}
